#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:5
#: 21ed352c704e4d6ab0f6cd9a0d287114 2218ec534cfd4ca382e4c459d4906e80
#: 3f7d45e0d05c4d5984a621b505623b26 5c1cb5f0ae9f447f9df9760652fdd9f8
#: b6593c9483924569943efb38070ad0eb f07257ec63a0487487e109baef6509a8
msgid "UBlox GPS + Compass Module"
msgstr "UBlox GPS + 罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:7
#: 100ed8626e7044a5b26ba2e040f4d0f6 290a87eca98746e99cd9ceb6be8718ab
#: 5b970f7813a146108236d884407ef228 8340c05855a84a83a7e85cf9bd2c869e
#: db8ed62e550c4735b7a36007a4283532 dea131b720e745acae0282cc460bdae6
msgid ""
"A UBlox GPS + Compass module is the most commonly used GPS for ArduPilot "
"compatible autopilots. There are many versions of these modules available "
"from various manufacturers, the recommended models are :ref:`here <common-"
"positioning-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"UBlox GPS + 罗盘模块是 ArduPilot 兼容飞控中最常用的 GPS。市面上有各厂商推出的众多版本，推荐型号请参阅 :ref:`此处 "
"<common-positioning-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:10
#: 59bac5f5cb3b4bf9b21ed86fa35f6dec 6ce3ccce75ea41859ffbbebec467bf5f
#: 7778dca345eb457bb7d78cc8d7128cfc 7dd32d1713ba46c8b0a52dfad1292f9e
#: e77ecf5fe6f54a999a23087436676d29 ec54b2386bab421ca76529c36ca3e448
msgid ""
"ArduPilot automatically configures the GPS soon after startup so there is no"
" need for any GPS related calibration.  The :ref:`compass must be calibrated"
" <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` however."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 在启动后不久会自动配置 GPS，因此无需进行任何 GPS 相关校准。但 :ref:`罗盘必须进行校准 <common-"
"compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:16
#: 1f4d47b9c2534b95aa88753239a7aa96 45c42fb335214b24808cb73e5c2d30d6
#: 4a437339f680488489e99d071973ac27 678490350d174dea970910ab6dee2c66
#: a0c51be7267d4eac9a499f00784771ee d6d10431630142f191621ebfc5c9fb4d
msgid "Connecting the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:25
#: 658925c751634888818b76ca4b8b8258 8e821e867c92413992253f7f260c9317
#: a2c068a8ed8f4e2ca7d00d859f4c2c57 a3d088207d1245d6b24706cede596665
#: ab091bd0f03642a5994fafba72348fd2 c5e9230123864503a538c21453b9770e
msgid "Example: Connecting to Pixhawk"
msgstr "示例：连接至 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:27
#: 0acbc7097213405c9e02e282e326422c 15978d48f057463cb39c575b378dc9ba
#: 387dd46248af44e18ac32f34ab923ed9 a2b6ad85ffec4349a1cc7626a8b7efeb
#: ab6a3739a6cb44ee89398009170beebc c4d10dd323924de28587d58bf4cd04b8
msgid ""
"Connect the GPS's 6-pin DF13 connector to the Pixhawk's \"GPS\" port and the"
" compass's 4-pin connector to the I2C port.  Alternatively the compass can "
"be first connected through an ``I2C splitter`` if other I2C devices are to "
"be attached."
msgstr ""
"将 GPS 的 6 针 DF13 接口连接至 Pixhawk 的「GPS」接口，将罗盘的 4 针接口连接至 I2C 接口。如需连接其他 I2C "
"设备，也可先通过 ``I2C splitter`` 连接罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:35
#: 129bd893822948abb3c784907c99a1f2 482f893e88fc4239b7bbf68c3790fe13
#: 4acc909073f843c5b784de5dbdcd8e53 76977df9f85a430193ce681cd24348ad
#: 815695298d104b5aa6a6fc3be03156d9 fa27582cb52b4f3ab49c97b365b5ee17
msgid ""
"Details on how to setup and use a 2nd GPS can be found on the :ref:`GPS "
"Blending page <common-gps-blending>` page."
msgstr "关于如何设置和使用第二个 GPS 的详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`GPS 融合页面 <common-gps-blending>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:39
#: 511b7e2bfe064bd9983775cbbc404a1a 59fbe6d1ef4e4b1d87805d505e08fd86
#: 6f6d728e25c8488ea90be3768b429eb8 7f25d4787a9b439f82e5bba93d5beb4a
#: c0b706b1bb4c49f5ad240764ca31db36 d6d990a96bdd4b759062b5e88ab808db
msgid ""
"The baud rate is set by the UBlox driver (setting ``SERIAL4_BAUD = 38`` is "
"ignored)."
msgstr "波特率由 UBlox 驱动设置（设置 ``SERIAL4_BAUD = 38`` 将被忽略）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:43
#: 058423ed15b7433ab9a60f174acc94ea 3496b7df98cf4d6d930a326a7e877f2f
#: 45fc6f7827c94813a7800dee373fcf75 4c7ecf9edd134ebea49b1f91e535a504
#: 98f3362c6b3341689dd173bfba813c7c f9dacf5f4ef34f8b9cfc47c92dd144c8
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports many attached compasses, but only up to 3 compasses can "
"be used during operation. See :ref:`common-compass-setup-advanced`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持连接多个罗盘，但运行时最多只能使用 3 个。请参阅 :ref:`common-compass-setup-advanced`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:47
#: 0986b4a1b4b84cdbbb05712981a5ce28 1cf1c7bfb28c4fbc9cf7de809c0512e2
#: 3b736739ad8249028a7b8373f6f204d2 4de75b4aa5dc4ba586900086b781ade8
#: bbee0fef971347f097f6543a7d21d929 f8e34d0ff5f5468d9d6e0e1330705317
msgid "Mounting the GPS Module"
msgstr "安装 GPS 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:49
#: 1fff06a217614c74a85321e0821db1d6 323dafe88f664e639388ea2a7091c589
#: 43cc4b7924fd42df93693aaa1bbf0f56 634365ff358d4d2ba646d191f8bc3f4a
#: b1b8784f3cb14c5dacf928a14bfcbc70 b3171a4e8a1a4185aabab29e77ec4799
msgid ""
"This module permits the GPS to be mounted separately from the flight control"
" module so that it can have the best clear (view) of the sky and allows the "
"compass to be distanced from interfering magnetic fields."
msgstr "该模块允许将 GPS 与飞控分开安装，使其能获得最佳的天空视野，同时使罗盘远离干扰磁场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:55
#: 1b4278a8ffb54932bf7d477fd1d133cd 2301283dca4041d6b346baa6d4a96f99
#: 5fc505ebb2b74704ab115bffeebf2123 62f5666dd3dd487593b5cc5cff278660
#: af64c15664d84669a64d65d5bc8c8596 ec972627a98748aeaa54cbb884e9cc42
msgid ""
"The recommended orientation is to mount the module with the arrow facing "
"toward the front of the vehicle and in the same direction as the arrow on "
"the autopilot."
msgstr "推荐的安装方向为箭头朝向飞行器前方，与飞控上的箭头方向一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:59
#: 339c05787dc84a55b4f55b7a21fde436 694906fd747c4c0c87ec4eda6d5f0cbb
#: 757520be78c643809d772325427840fe a17c2056d7e445cd9c8657f7963bdeb8
#: a5e91340a4c348e09eb9e54381e7189e b18dd5ad4ca7447b969624e1b84b2213
msgid "When mounting the GPS+Compass module:"
msgstr "安装 GPS+罗盘模块时："

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:61
#: 4eb1a232e7574f12a56581c9e6c60476 73c0252d6993413ba2392378b9815348
#: b55a96e74e594d5f83ab6571e2622f51 c2f55a4415f14c40bfbb0e09b4afa0c0
#: cadfb539dad14145b7e7ce3c0ac89f08 eb162d0ea66d42ffb74dc6a08ab5d341
msgid ""
"Place the module on the outside of your vehicle (in an elevated position if "
"appropriate) with a clear view of the sky, as far as possible from the "
"motors and ESCs, with the arrow facing forward."
msgstr "将模块安装在飞行器外部（如条件允许，安装在较高位置），确保天空视野开阔，尽量远离电机和 ESC，箭头朝向前方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:64
#: 3e3e6c7ab6ba4ad3ac29fd911a797fda 690885fe02af4eadb928a7fe2f64bd8c
#: 7fb1aa5d5c594841aaae19450a1bb45a 80c8681d9ae54314ab3da393033a60e6
#: 88449b05f33f4c61ba1dee5da57c5348 b60cd7f558d34e0bb8636d0a9c9b8542
msgid ""
"Distance the module from DC power wiring and the batteries by at least 10cm."
"  Use of a GPS mast is highly recommended."
msgstr "模块与直流电源线路和电池的距离应至少保持 10 cm。强烈建议使用 GPS 支柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:70
#: 1ed588be9ebe41f1b75527765bff5dbc 5d4cfe009d924b73bfdb75c89d6e92d1
#: c473e2556971493fb9cb9e36e043f16c c9e564eb484f4569b3a5132e34cee7e8
#: e0b6492edcce4a2083a4e35d524c1aa2 f3e65f5deb7d4d319b67d69865c29a54
msgid ""
"Place the module clear of nearby iron containing metallic objects. (Use "
"nylon or non magnetic stainless steel hardware and nylon or aluminum "
"standoffs to mount the module)."
msgstr "模块应远离含铁金属物体。（使用尼龙或无磁不锈钢螺丝，以及尼龙或铝质支柱固定模块。）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:73
#: 67ab9bfc06b247f1898b7789191d61bf 6c2afcc7d89c41fc9cf8ac94396e9fb5
#: 92878708c572444796e6115ed3561898 a0f4a32a05be4e45b09eb7199fa5ed5f
#: a8dfc71febe04fd682c2a359e9151803 fbd4c8cffc1f4eda9a4a6e49a7b4bf7d
msgid "Twist power and ground wires where possible."
msgstr "尽可能将电源线和地线扭在一起走线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:79
#: 2e77b6d05378430f8b24e9f8aec24e3d 307db1acaeee4802abccaa7596b3e08f
#: 4d291299158f4a219ef3fe1177a64f62 71a7973d79784d63937d60dae3d41f37
#: 76326ae10ef641fa82901286e6f7fdae af9cbafb09a44b628c2a10d611b17b64
msgid "Setup in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在Mission Planner中设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:81
#: 208ff66500d6445e80c1a2013af55630 2c8050744287438fbc5f3e3d593cc4e4
#: ba6b6e0f24e5475db9b04d6c9c2cf095 bb810ab879c14b33b27fcdd94382c9a4
#: c2808645ba384d85bd44b514526f58fb c5689e6045dc4635902d9d21c3997249
msgid ""
":ref:`Compass Calibration in Mission Planner <common-compass-calibration-in-"
"mission-planner>` explains the simplest way to calibrate a compass mounted "
"in the recommended orientation (arrows for autopilot and compass facing to "
"front of vehicle)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`在Mission Planner中进行罗盘校准 <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner>` 介绍了按推荐方向安装罗盘（飞控和罗盘的箭头均朝向飞行器前方）时的最简单校准方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:86
#: 047d79a0b94a4d25a356c7b6f9ad423d 0e2aed56f9ee459fb29f971ff8f823f9
#: 5085296f1d4d4d7596462ee5a00c5022 5c037ca9a51e4444b61053a5d68ba48d
#: 79e9e3b4d8c147d3b0bcb98ac1eccf89 cc0de1c7b9874f1fb358a2347c8fb83d
msgid ""
":ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>` contains more "
"detailed instructions for calibrating a compass if, for example, it has been"
" mounted at some other orientation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`高级罗盘设置 <common-compass-setup-advanced>` "
"包含更详细的罗盘校准说明，适用于例如以其他方向安装罗盘的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:91
#: 2342ba51b625433d8711d4ad8773f87a 262cd386117c47ba83c9907dc13d6d02
#: 2e432cc3fd414a6a923a4cc662012df4 52e38103d94840ffb9e01d29c8c0c696
#: 7726f04872534878a50c1a7e25c9c69e 89a1b419362142b6a67a650c17500878
msgid "LED Indicators"
msgstr "LED 指示灯"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:93
#: 08491b554ea5463bb1437fb50ac8d937 6ef2db19ce3b4656a8b20d29f204b89d
#: 7749c58f562248fba2e6406dc923867d d3f3c403be20444db9ad82201d0cb39b
#: ec8d8bd9b76f4baa89e97e554f36aefa f38d4c845af44247bdb9cb2a16d6095b
msgid ""
"The 3DR GPS+Compass module has two LED indicators: one for power (solid red)"
" and one for GPS lock (flashing blue). Most GPS have an led indicator for 3D"
" GPS lock acquisition."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS+罗盘模块有两个 LED 指示灯：一个电源指示灯（常亮红色）和一个 GPS 定位指示灯（闪烁蓝色）。大多数 GPS 模块都有 LED "
"指示灯用于显示 3D GPS 锁定状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:97
#: 1ef6282e0ec44adcab744c9c23be5abc 443fd0bf547f4083941da8fc75dfcd47
